{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"787a592712ba909260d90e3ed6db1b12aa90c2c4b8d1994f01f9da5eaf4baa98","ja":"先生も一緒に","zh":"老师也一起来","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"411e37e284a8ce627a2dc159bd9db122717acf1184abf016483fb7e7d1c925b7","ja":"えへへっ♪　ちゃんと動かせるようになりましたね。\nゲームも、さっきより楽しくなってきたかも♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪　已经能熟练操作了呢。\n游戏好像也比刚才变得更有意思了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3efe1e6a66cfe0ef6c0474ce657ae339e82fcfb1dbcf021cd065e8c32a8b55e6","ja":"ええ。でも、なかなか点数が入らなかったり\nするから、まだ見ている人には伝わらないかも……。","zh":"是的。不过，由于很难轻易拿下一分，\n可能还没办法传达给在看的人……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f9069a2e423c98bf84a7b34c60023c0a1c5605b929f51e190a2d52fa1024dca6","ja":"ごめん、なさい……。\n杏奈がもっと……教えるの上手、だったら……。","zh":"对不、起……。\n要是杏奈……再擅长教人、一点的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"71f799f6f1f8cc6dee1fbcc212547b92aaaf09efa2c6df110d2735d059ca2176","ja":"そ、そんなことないよ！　杏奈ちゃんのおかげで\nちゃんとゲームらしく見えるようになってきたし。","zh":"没、没有那回事啦！多亏了杏奈，\n看起来已经挺有游戏的样子了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"bffd1e69dc90b08ad1ad442eedb528712f32ebc0671dd11694d7b04b97dc6c38","ja":"そうよ。杏奈ちゃんに教えてもらいながらじゃないと、\nまだまだ不安なくらいだし……そうだわ！","zh":"没错。要不是有杏奈教我，\n我都还很不放心呢……对了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"873c38ace7772b0447b534dd707cc91c86dc3095bd03351c8322c22e295bb14e","ja":"配信のことで、ちょっと\nプロデューサーさんに相談してみましょ♪","zh":"关于直播的事情，去找\n制作人商量一下吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"2d89febb98b0462d79e092889f9bfe3de9dc4c636152f2e247119766fc32cfc5","ja":"そして配信当日……","zh":"然后到了直播当天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d6aa42f751cfe082b276f6adbbfc33893454ae6aa0a1af513def402334b4e15b","ja":"今日は私たちで新発売のゲームを遊びます。\n4人で遊ぶパーティゲームなのですが……。","zh":"今天由我们来玩刚发售的新游戏。\n虽然是一款4人一起玩的派对游戏……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"69d8125981adb054755e139587d43cfedf98b5508e03ef8de7e4b2f6f8bba247","ja":"急遽、ゲストに来ていただくことになりました♪\nご紹介しますね。望月杏奈ちゃんです～♪","zh":"临时请到了一位嘉宾哦♪\n我来为大家介绍一下。这位是望月杏奈～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"30505cb51bcb21a6e4ce9d1a7d1d38ce60ec99c397737c6ad6f85faaa7460bb3","ja":"イェーイ！　今日は杏奈が先生として、\n先輩たちにレクチャーしちゃうよー！","zh":"耶——！今天杏奈要作为老师，\n来给前辈们讲课哦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"a98e684b277c639ebcb498481c46374214d064234c64f4401c3cd739324e5e59","ja":"杏奈先生、よろしくお願いしまーすっ！","zh":"杏奈老师，拜托你啦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"add0d0661f397a781400f376b706c56e7cace681a2fbf043139385780a33c96f","ja":"杏奈ちゃんのアドバイスを聞けば、\n初心者の人でもきっと、一緒に楽しめると思いますぅ♪","zh":"听了杏奈的建议，\n就算是初学者，也一定能一起玩得很开心的～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1286.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"205a6a3a98304aba39043ac6f1651ce3d9e372af84e195a7251ecb754f57a683","ja":"杏奈が教えたら、バッチリだからね♪\nそれじゃあ、ビビッといっくよー！","zh":"有杏奈教你，绝对没问题的♪\n那么，一口气冲刺吧——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:41:40+00:00"}
